0,Yurok language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yurok_language,"Yurok (also Chillula, Mita, Pekwan, Rikwa, Sugon, Weitspek, Weitspekan) is an Algic language. [2] It is the traditional language of the Yurok people of Del Norte County and Humboldt County on the far north coast of California, most of whom now speak English.",Yurok,Algic
